        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cedarmount Parkland Living with Heritage at its Heart\n\nA-Rated 3 Bedroom Duplex Homes\n\nRegister Your Interest at: \nhttps://cedarmount.ie/#register-interest\n\nCedarmount's 3 bedroom duplex homes offer the ideal balance between the space of a house and the convenience of apartment living.\n\nThese homes are designed with flexibility in mind, featuring generous layouts and high-quality finishes throughout. Kitchens incorporate bespoke joinery and considered detailing, while bathrooms feature clean, modern layouts with integrated storage, feature lighting and elegant tiling. \n\nPositioned within a mature, landscaped setting, residents benefit from a peaceful environment alongside exceptional access to local amenities and transport connections.\n\nThe inclusion of Cedarmount House as a dedicated residents' hub further enhances daily life, offering spaces for leisure, wellness and community interaction in a beautifully restored heritage building. \n\nKey Features:\n- A-rated duplex homes\n- Generous, flexible layouts\n- Premium kitchen and bathroom specification\n- Landscaped surroundings\n- Exclusive residents' amenities"
